concept "Low BMI Procedure Justified by Underweight Diagnosis":
- type is Procedure.
- value type is CodeableConcept.
- definition is "cms69-RecordSource"."Low BMI Follow-up Procedures" justified by "cms69-RecordSource"."Underweight Diagnoses".

concept "Low BMI Follow-up Procedures Performed":
- type is Procedure.
- value type is CodeableConcept.
